		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Party A shall issue invoices to Party B on a quarterly basis based on the scope, workload and commercial value of the services provided and the pricing agreed by the Parties. Party B shall pay the relevant consulting and service fees to Party A or its designee by the due date and in the amount specified in the invoice.</P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Party A may adjust the service fee standards at any time based on the quantity and content of the services provided. Such adjustment shall become effective upon written notice to Party B.</P>
