		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Party A:&#x00a0;Erhua Medical Technology (Changzhou) Co., Ltd. (the &#x201c;Pledgee&#x201d;), a limited liability company duly organized and existing under PRC law, with its registered address at No. 33 Xiangyun Road, Jiangsu Wujin Economic Development Zone, and unified social credit code 91320412MA22J9TA7M;</P>
